<h1>02 - Cookie options</h1>

<p>
    Same app as 01, but with a custom scheme name ("MyCookie") and all the important
    cookie options set explicitly in <code>Program.cs</code>.
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Open the browser dev tools (Application &rarr; Cookies) to see the <code>MyAuthCookie</code> cookie.</li>
    <li>Log in with and without <b>Remember me</b> and compare the cookie's Expires column.</li>
    <li><b>Secret</b> shows when the login was issued and when it expires (after 1 minute).</li>
</ul>
